      "message": "fix(motion): the contour refusal for an Arc entry with no lead-in names the lead-in\n\nA non-centre-cutting tool with the Arc entry and a None lead-in is refused\nat the grazing dive. The old hint said \"pick the Arc entry\", which the user\nhad already set. The hint now says that the Arc entry does not run when the\nlead-in is None, and that the user can set a Linear or Arc lead-in or use a\ncentre-cutting tool. The refusal condition is unchanged.\n\nFixes #3247\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
